  "description": "Sa Baek-Min, the guildmaster of the “From” Hunter Guild, has gone missing in a dungeon. Deputy Guildmaster Baek Sin-A enters the dungeon, which is currently in the midst of its breeding season, to find him. There, she encounters an unknown incubus monster named Glitch...\n\n *“I'll protect you until we find that hunter. In return, give me your life force.”*\n\nTo make matters worse, she has to calm the boss’s heat before she can proceed to the next floor? The sizzling tale of B-rank hunter Baek Sin-A and the incubus monster Glitch as they take down the boss♥\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
